<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices-Jan 16.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices-Jan 16.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Wheat Board international card prices for wheat exports for January 16.</p>
<p>In U.S. dollars per tonne, FOB eastern states.</p>
<p>		ASW	  AH     PH 13 PCT PH 14 PCT</p>
<p>    Jan    203.00    207.50    209.50    221.00</p>
<p>    Feb    203.00    207.50    209.50    221.00</p>
<p>    Mar    203.00    207.50    209.50    221.00</p>
<p>    Apr    203.00    207.50    209.50    221.00</p>
<p>    May    203.00    207.50    209.50    221.00</p>
<p>    Jun    203.00    207.50    209.50    221.00</p>
<p>Note: ASW = Australian Standard White; AH = Australian Hard; PH = Australian Prime Hard; percentages = protein content.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
